<title>FRANCE: Lagardere stresses Thomson synergy -paper.</title>
<headline>Lagardere stresses Thomson synergy -paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A merger between French defence firm Matra and military electronics company Thomson-CSF would bring together key technologies similar to the integrated groups in the United States, said Noel Forgeard, Groupe Lagardere managing director.</p>
<p>He told the Sunday newspaper Journal de Dimanche, &quot;Between our missiles and satellites and Thomson's equipment, we have all the capabilities to offer complete systems.&quot;</p>
<p>Lagardere has made an offer for state-owned electronics firm Thomson SA in order to merge its Thomson-CSF unit with its Matra Defense Espace subsidiary.</p>
</text>
